      https://github.com/catppuccin/sublime-text
      Copyright (c) 2021 Catppuccin

  dracula, dracula-soft
      https://github.com/dracula/visual-studio-code
      Copyright (c) 2016 Dracula Theme

  gruvbox
      https://github.com/Briles/gruvbox
      Copyright (c) 2016 Brian Reilly

  night-owl, night-owl-noitalic, night-owl-light, night-owl-light-noitalic
      https://github.com/sdras/night-owl-vscode-theme
      Copyright (c) 2018 Sarah Drasner

  nord
      https://github.com/nordtheme/sublime-text
      Copyright (c) 2016-present Sven Greb <development@svengreb.de> (https://www.svengreb.de)

  rose-pine
      https://github.com/rose-pine/sublime-text
      Copyright (c) Rosé Pine

